Package: itamos-mcp-tools
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 20), npm, build-essential, python3, git, zfsutils-linux, adduser, ca-certificates
Recommends: chromium | chromium-browser | google-chrome-stable
Maintainer: Konstantinos Karamperis <info@itamos-technologia.com>
Homepage: https://itamos-technologia.com/mcp-hosting.html
Description: Itamos MCP Tools sandbox server
 Five MCP tools that let an AI agent see and change code the way an engineer
 does: master_architect (project map), read_file (segment editor with
 verification, undo and clipboard), write_file, a sandboxed git and
 web_skeleton (web perception), served to many users at once, each in a
 private ZFS sandbox with a hard size limit.
 .
 The pinned Node.js dependencies are installed during setup with npm ci, so
 installing needs internet access. The server needs ZFS slots before it starts:
 create them with itamos-mcp-create-slots.
